# photocraft 0.3.0: target_arch = "wasm32" means the browser build
# (apps/photocraft-web) here; Kandelo takes the native paths (files
# opened by path, rayon threads, rfd, arboard, open). Every such cfg reads
# all(target_arch = "wasm32", not(target_os = "kandelo")). Kandelo has no
# X server, so the app asks eframe for Wayland only there.
diff -ruN a/apps/photocraft/Cargo.toml b/apps/photocraft/Cargo.toml
--- a/apps/photocraft/Cargo.toml	2026-10-08 18:09:51
+++ b/apps/photocraft/Cargo.toml	2026-10-08 18:09:51
@@ -24,15 +24,19 @@
